# 25-word Algorand mnemonic of the agent/merchant wallet that pays for prints.
#
# HACKATHON NOTE: holding a signing mnemonic in a server-side .env is a
# deliberate shortcut. It removes the need for Pera Wallet (no human signs on a
# phone) so the backend can pay an offer programmatically. The wallet must:
#   - hold testnet USDC (ASA 10458941) + a little ALGO for fees
#   - be opted into the USDC ASA (see x402_transactions/utilities/opt_in_account.js)
# Never use a real / mainnet-funded mnemonic here.
AVM_MNEMONIC="word1 word2 word3 ... word25"
